/AP << /N 1509 0 R >> /Contents (During training, the model converts all three patent texts into numerical vectors \($V_F$, $V_P$, $V_N$\) and calculates the distance between them.\012\012During training, the model converts all three patent texts into numerical vectors \($V_F$, $V_P$, $V_N$\) and calculates the distance between them.\012Goal: Pull the Positive Patent closer to the Focal Patent in vector space while pushing the Negative Patent further away.\012Triplet Margin Loss: The mathematical loss function evaluates whether the positive representation is closer to the focal representation than the negative representation by at least a predefined safety margin \($m$\). If the negative patent is too close, the model adjusts its internal weights to improve its accuracy.)
/T (Brian Daniel Bernhardt) /Popup 1503 0 R >>
endobj
